    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nThe \"I did it today\" button is already wired up. Use it as a model to build another button.\r\n\r\n1. Look at `logHabit` in `script.js`. Notice the named arrow function and how it's connected.\r\n\r\n2. Open `spec.md` and pick one button to build.\r\n\r\n3. Under your chosen spec in `spec.md`, finish the two sentences (`[Specify]` and `[Predict]`).\r\n\r\n4. Highlight your button's full spec (including what you wrote) and send it to AI Tutor. Ask for a named arrow function.\r\n\r\n5. Write an `addEventListener` line to connect your function, then click the button to test it.",
    "display_name": "Wellness Coach",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Bloom</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"phone\">\n\n    <!-- Top bar with brand + user -->\n    <header class=\"app-header\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\">✿</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">Bloom</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"user-chip\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">S</span>\n        <span class=\"username\">@sage_grows</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Gentle status -->\n    <div class=\"intention\">\n      <span class=\"intention-label\">Today's intention</span>\n      <span class=\"intention-text\">Being gentle with myself</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Big streak card -->\n    <section class=\"streak-card\">\n      <div class=\"streak-icon\">🌱</div>\n      <p class=\"streak-amount\"><span id=\"streakDisplay\">0</span></p>\n      <p class=\"streak-label\">days strong</p>\n      <div class=\"streak-meta\">\n        <span class=\"meta-pill\">your best: 14 days</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-pill\">this week: every day</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Action buttons -->\n    <section class=\"actions\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">How was today?</h2>\n      <div class=\"button-stack\">\n        <button id=\"logHabitButton\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n          <span class=\"btn-icon\">✓</span>\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">I did it today</span>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"button-row\">\n          <button id=\"breakStreakButton\" class=\"btn btn-soft\">\n            <span class=\"btn-icon\">☾</span>\n            <span class=\"btn-label\">Mark a rest day</span>\n          </button>\n          <button id=\"boostStreakButton\" class=\"btn btn-soft\">\n            <span class=\"btn-icon\">✦</span>\n            <span class=\"btn-label\">Boost streak</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"resetButton\" class=\"btn btn-quiet\">\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">Start over</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Decorative weekly reflection -->\n    <section class=\"reflection\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">This week's reflections</h2>\n      <ul class=\"reflection-list\">\n        <li class=\"reflection-item\">\n          <div class=\"reflection-day\">Sat</div>\n          <div class=\"reflection-body\">\n            <div class=\"reflection-mood\">🌿 felt grounded</div>\n            <div class=\"reflection-note\">walked to the farmers market with mom. quiet and good.</div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"reflection-item\">\n          <div class=\"reflection-day\">Fri</div>\n          <div class=\"reflection-body\">\n            <div class=\"reflection-mood\">☀ energized</div>\n            <div class=\"reflection-note\">finished my essay early. felt proud.</div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"reflection-item\">\n          <div class=\"reflection-day\">Thu</div>\n          <div class=\"reflection-body\">\n            <div class=\"reflection-mood\">🌧 tired</div>\n            <div class=\"reflection-note\">long day but i still showed up. that counts.</div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  background: #fef7ed;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 28px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.phone {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  background: #fafaf7;\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 28px 22px 32px;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(127, 166, 135, 0.12);\n}\n\n/* ─── Header ─── */\n.app-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.brand-mark {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  color: #7fa687;\n}\n\n.brand-name {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n}\n\n.user-chip {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 4px 12px 4px 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n.avatar {\n  width: 26px;\n  height: 26px;\n  background: #d4a574;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.username {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #7a7068;\n}\n\n/* ─── Intention line ─── */\n.intention {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.intention-label {\n  display: block;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #7a7068;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.intention-text {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n}\n\n/* ─── Streak card ─── */\n.streak-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0f5ed 0%, #ffffff 100%);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 32px 24px 28px;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(127, 166, 135, 0.08);\n}\n\n.streak-icon {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.streak-amount {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 64px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.streak-label {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #7a7068;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.streak-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.meta-pill {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #7a7068;\n  background: rgba(127, 166, 135, 0.1);\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n/* ─── Section titles ─── */\n.section-title {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 17px;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n/* ─── Action buttons ─── */\n.actions {\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n\n.button-stack {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.button-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  border: none;\n  transition: transform 0.12s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n.btn-icon {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.btn-label {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: inherit;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #7fa687;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(127, 166, 135, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(127, 166, 135, 0.35);\n}\n\n.btn-soft {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n.btn-soft:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n}\n\n.btn-quiet {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #7a7068;\n  box-shadow: none;\n  padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn-quiet:hover {\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n}\n\n/* ─── Reflection list ─── */\n.reflection-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.reflection-item {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 14px;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);\n}\n\n.reflection-day {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #7fa687;\n  width: 28px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  padding-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.reflection-body {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.reflection-mood {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.reflection-note {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #7a7068;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// State variable for the streak count\nlet streak = 0;\n\n// Get reference to the display element\nconst streakDisplay = document.getElementById(\"streakDisplay\");\n\n// Named arrow function: increases the streak by one\nconst logHabit = () => {\n  streak = streak + 1;\n  streakDisplay.textContent = streak;\n};\n\n// Connect the function to the Log Habit button\nconst logHabitButton = document.getElementById(\"logHabitButton\");\nlogHabitButton.addEventListener(\"click\", logHabit);\n\n// === Add your code below ===\n\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "spec.md",
          "contents": "---\nName of Button: I did it today   ← Already done as the example\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: The streak grows\nWhat on the page changes: The streak readout updates\n---\n\n\nName of Button: Mark a rest day\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: A rest day is recorded\nWhat on the page changes: The streak readout updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n\nName of Button: Boost streak\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: The streak gets a bonus\nWhat on the page changes: The streak readout updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n\nName of Button: Start over\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: Reset everything to start over\nWhat on the page changes: The streak returns to its starting state\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
    },
